**/node_modules
.git
.claude
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
# No non-example YAML enters the build context: market-making configuration is YAML, may hold a
# private key, and `--config` accepts any operator-chosen filename — not just the default
# market-making.yaml. Images need no YAML at runtime; committed *.example.* templates stay copyable.
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml
!**/*.example.yaml
!**/*.example.yml
